1
00:00:12,525 --> 00:00:15,125
Hear me and rejoice.

2
00:00:15,125 --> 00:00:18,575
You have had the privilege of being saved
by The Great Titan.

3
00:00:18,625 --> 00:00:21,925
You may think this is suffering, no.

4
00:00:21,925 --> 00:00:23,780
It is salvation.

5
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:27,760
The universal scales tip towards balance because of your sacrifice blah blah blah

6
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:31,060
Smile for even in death you have become children of Thanos.

7
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:31,920
There.

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,180
May I be excused?

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:36,380
Well, it really didn't feel like your heart was in it.

10
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:40,280
That's because my heart WASN'T IN IT
SPONGEBOB!

11
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,680
*Plankton laughs like a bad guy*

12
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:44,360
*SNAP*

13
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:48,660
*Laughs* I'm delicious!

